"mikroorganizmov in esencialnih hranil, ki izboljšujejo rodovitnost tal in "
"spodbujajo zdravo rast rastlin, ko se uporabljajo na vrtovih in pridelkih."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.soil_guard_vermi_compost_powder
msgid ""
"Vermicompost powder is a nutrient-rich organic fertilizer produced through "
"vermicomposting. This process involves introducing composting worms to a "
"controlled environment, where they consume and break down organic waste "
"materials such as kitchen scraps and plant debris. As the worms digest the "
"waste, it undergoes microbial decomposition, resulting in nutrient-rich worm "
"castings. These castings are collected, separated from the bedding, and then "
"dried to an appropriate moisture level."
msgstr ""
"Vermikompost v prahu je organsko gnojilo, bogato s hranili, proizvedeno z "
"vermikompostiranjem. Ta postopek vključuje vnos kompostnih črvov v "
"nadzorovano okolje, kjer uživajo in razgrajujejo organske odpadke, kot so "
"kuhinjski ostanki in rastlinski odpadki. Ko črvi prebavljajo odpadke, se ti "
"mikrobno razgradijo, kar ima za posledico s hranili bogate odlitke črvov. Ti "
"odlitki se zberejo, ločijo od stelje in nato posušijo do ustrezne ravni "
"vlage."

